{"id":"de-l01","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":1,"title":"Hello & introductions","phrases":[{"ar":"Hallo!","roman":"HAH-loh","en":"Hello!","ur":"ہیلو!","note":"Works everywhere, any time of day."},{"ar":"Guten Morgen!","roman":"GOO-ten MOR-gen","en":"Good morning!","ur":"صبح بخیر!","note":"Until about 11 am."},{"ar":"Guten Tag!","roman":"GOO-ten tahk","en":"Good day / Hello (formal)","ur":"السلام علیکم (دن کے وقت)","note":"The safe greeting in shops and offices."},{"ar":"Guten Abend!","roman":"GOO-ten AH-bent","en":"Good evening!","ur":"شام بخیر!"},{"ar":"Wie geht es Ihnen?","roman":"vee GAYT es EE-nen","en":"How are you? (formal)","ur":"آپ کیسے ہیں؟","note":"Use 'Ihnen' with strangers, 'dir' with friends: Wie geht's dir?"},{"ar":"Gut, danke. Und Ihnen?","roman":"goot, DAHN-keh. oont EE-nen","en":"Fine, thanks. And you?","ur":"ٹھیک ہوں، شکریہ۔ اور آپ؟"},{"ar":"Ich heiße Shakeel.","roman":"ikh HY-seh Shakeel","en":"My name is Shakeel.","ur":"میرا نام شکیل ہے۔","note":"'ß' sounds like 'ss'."},{"ar":"Wie heißen Sie?","roman":"vee HY-sen zee","en":"What is your name? (formal)","ur":"آپ کا نام کیا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ich komme aus Pakistan.","roman":"ikh KOM-meh ows pah-kis-TAHN","en":"I come from Pakistan.","ur":"میں پاکستان سے ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Ich wohne in Dubai.","roman":"ikh VOH-neh in doo-BY","en":"I live in Dubai.","ur":"میں دبئی میں رہتا ہوں۔","note":"German 'w' sounds like English 'v'."},{"ar":"Freut mich!","roman":"froyt mikh","en":"Nice to meet you!","ur":"آپ سے مل کر خوشی ہوئی!","note":"'ch' after i/e is a soft hiss, like a cat: 'ikh'."},{"ar":"Auf Wiedersehen!","roman":"owf VEE-der-zay-en","en":"Goodbye!","ur":"خدا حافظ!","note":"Short and friendly: Tschüss! (chüss)"}]},
{"id":"de-l02","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":2,"title":"Please, thanks, sorry","phrases":[{"ar":"Bitte.","roman":"BIT-teh","en":"Please. / You're welcome.","ur":"براہ مہربانی۔ / کوئی بات نہیں۔","note":"One word, two jobs."},{"ar":"Danke!","roman":"DAHN-keh","en":"Thank you!","ur":"شکریہ!"},{"ar":"Vielen Dank!","roman":"FEE-len dahnk","en":"Thank you very much!","ur":"بہت بہت شکریہ!"},{"ar":"Entschuldigung!","roman":"ent-SHOOL-dee-goong","en":"Excuse me! / Sorry!","ur":"معاف کیجیے!","note":"Use it to get attention or to apologise."},{"ar":"Es tut mir leid.","roman":"es toot meer lyt","en":"I'm sorry.","ur":"مجھے افسوس ہے۔"},{"ar":"Ja.","roman":"yah","en":"Yes.","ur":"ہاں۔","note":"German 'j' sounds like English 'y'."},{"ar":"Nein.","roman":"nyn","en":"No.","ur":"نہیں۔"},{"ar":"Kein Problem.","roman":"kyn pro-BLAYM","en":"No problem.","ur":"کوئی مسئلہ نہیں۔"},{"ar":"Ich verstehe nicht.","roman":"ikh fer-SHTAY-eh nikht","en":"I don't understand.","ur":"میں نہیں سمجھا۔"},{"ar":"Sprechen Sie Englisch?","roman":"SHPREKH-en zee ENG-lish","en":"Do you speak English?","ur":"کیا آپ انگریزی بولتے ہیں؟","note":"'sp' at the start of a word sounds 'shp'."},{"ar":"Langsamer, bitte.","roman":"LAHNG-zah-mer, BIT-teh","en":"Slower, please.","ur":"ذرا آہستہ، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Noch einmal, bitte.","roman":"nokh YN-mahl, BIT-teh","en":"Once more, please.","ur":"ایک بار پھر، براہ مہربانی۔"}]},
{"id":"de-l03","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":3,"title":"Numbers","phrases":[{"ar":"eins, zwei, drei","roman":"yns, tsvy, dry","en":"one, two, three","ur":"ایک، دو، تین","note":"'z' sounds like 'ts'."},{"ar":"vier, fünf, sechs","roman":"feer, fünf, zeks","en":"four, five, six","ur":"چار، پانچ، چھ","note":"'ü': say 'ee' with rounded lips."},{"ar":"sieben, acht, neun","roman":"ZEE-ben, ahkht, noyn","en":"seven, eight, nine","ur":"سات، آٹھ، نو","note":"'ch' after a/o/u is the throaty 'kh' like Urdu خ."},{"ar":"zehn","roman":"tsayn","en":"ten","ur":"دس"},{"ar":"zwanzig","roman":"TSVAHN-tsikh","en":"twenty","ur":"بیس"},{"ar":"hundert","roman":"HOON-dert","en":"one hundred","ur":"سو"},{"ar":"tausend","roman":"TOW-zent","en":"one thousand","ur":"ہزار"},{"ar":"Wie viel kostet das?","roman":"vee feel KOS-tet dahs","en":"How much does this cost?","ur":"یہ کتنے کا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Das kostet zehn Euro.","roman":"dahs KOS-tet tsayn OY-roh","en":"That costs ten euros.","ur":"یہ دس یورو کا ہے۔"},{"ar":"Zimmer Nummer zwölf","roman":"TSIM-mer NOO-mer tsvölf","en":"Room number twelve","ur":"کمرہ نمبر بارہ"},{"ar":"Meine Nummer ist ...","roman":"MY-neh NOO-mer ist","en":"My number is ...","ur":"میرا نمبر ہے ..."}]},
{"id":"de-l04","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":4,"title":"Days & time","phrases":[{"ar":"Montag, Dienstag, Mittwoch","roman":"MOHN-tahk, DEENS-tahk, MIT-vokh","en":"Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday","ur":"پیر، منگل، بدھ"},{"ar":"Donnerstag, Freitag","roman":"DON-ers-tahk, FRY-tahk","en":"Thursday, Friday","ur":"جمعرات، جمعہ"},{"ar":"Samstag, Sonntag","roman":"ZAHMS-tahk, ZON-tahk","en":"Saturday, Sunday","ur":"ہفتہ، اتوار","note":"Most shops in Germany are closed on Sunday."},{"ar":"heute","roman":"HOY-teh","en":"today","ur":"آج"},{"ar":"morgen","roman":"MOR-gen","en":"tomorrow","ur":"کل (آنے والا)"},{"ar":"gestern","roman":"GES-tern","en":"yesterday","ur":"کل (گزرا ہوا)"},{"ar":"Wie spät ist es?","roman":"vee shpayt ist es","en":"What time is it?","ur":"کیا وقت ہوا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Es ist drei Uhr.","roman":"es ist dry oor","en":"It is three o'clock.","ur":"تین بجے ہیں۔"},{"ar":"um halb zehn","roman":"oom hahlp tsayn","en":"at half past nine","ur":"ساڑھے نو بجے","note":"Careful: 'halb zehn' means half TO ten = 9:30."},{"ar":"am Wochenende","roman":"ahm VOKH-en-en-deh","en":"at the weekend","ur":"ہفتے کے آخر میں"},{"ar":"Haben Sie morgen Zeit?","roman":"HAH-ben zee MOR-gen tsyt","en":"Are you free tomorrow?","ur":"کیا آپ کل فارغ ہیں؟"}]},
{"id":"de-l05","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":5,"title":"At the airport","phrases":[{"ar":"Wo ist der Ausgang?","roman":"voh ist dair OWS-gahng","en":"Where is the exit?","ur":"باہر نکلنے کا راستہ کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Wo ist die Gepäckausgabe?","roman":"voh ist dee geh-PEK-ows-gah-beh","en":"Where is baggage claim?","ur":"سامان کہاں ملے گا؟"},{"ar":"Mein Koffer ist nicht da.","roman":"myn KOF-fer ist nikht dah","en":"My suitcase isn't here.","ur":"میرا سوٹ کیس نہیں آیا۔"},{"ar":"Hier ist mein Pass.","roman":"heer ist myn pahs","en":"Here is my passport.","ur":"یہ میرا پاسپورٹ ہے۔"},{"ar":"Ich bin hier für eine Woche.","roman":"ikh bin heer für Y-neh VO-kheh","en":"I'm here for one week.","ur":"میں یہاں ایک ہفتے کے لیے ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Ich bin geschäftlich hier.","roman":"ikh bin geh-SHEFT-likh heer","en":"I'm here on business.","ur":"میں کام کے سلسلے میں آیا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Ich mache Urlaub.","roman":"ikh MAH-kheh OOR-lowp","en":"I'm on holiday.","ur":"میں چھٹیوں پر ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Wo fährt der Zug in die Stadt?","roman":"voh fairt dair tsook in dee shtaht","en":"Where does the train to the city leave?","ur":"شہر جانے والی ٹرین کہاں سے چلتی ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ein Taxi, bitte.","roman":"yn TAHK-see, BIT-teh","en":"A taxi, please.","ur":"ایک ٹیکسی، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Mein Flug hat Verspätung.","roman":"myn flook haht fer-SHPAY-toong","en":"My flight is delayed.","ur":"میری فلائٹ لیٹ ہے۔"}]},
{"id":"de-l06","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":6,"title":"At the hotel","phrases":[{"ar":"Ich habe eine Reservierung.","roman":"ikh HAH-beh Y-neh reh-zer-VEER-oong","en":"I have a reservation.","ur":"میری بکنگ ہے۔"},{"ar":"Auf den Namen Qureshi.","roman":"owf dayn NAH-men koo-RAY-shee","en":"Under the name Qureshi.","ur":"قریشی کے نام پر۔"},{"ar":"Ein Zimmer für zwei Nächte.","roman":"yn TSIM-mer für tsvy NEKH-teh","en":"A room for two nights.","ur":"دو راتوں کے لیے ایک کمرہ۔"},{"ar":"Ist das Frühstück inklusive?","roman":"ist dahs FRÜ-shtük in-kloo-ZEE-veh","en":"Is breakfast included?","ur":"کیا ناشتہ شامل ہے؟"},{"ar":"Wann ist das Frühstück?","roman":"vahn ist dahs FRÜ-shtük","en":"When is breakfast?","ur":"ناشتہ کب ہوتا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Wie ist das WLAN-Passwort?","roman":"vee ist dahs VAY-lahn PAHS-vort","en":"What is the Wi-Fi password?","ur":"وائی فائی کا پاس ورڈ کیا ہے؟","note":"Wi-Fi is 'WLAN' (vay-lahn) in German."},{"ar":"Die Klimaanlage funktioniert nicht.","roman":"dee KLEE-mah-ahn-lah-geh foonk-tsyo-NEERT nikht","en":"The air conditioning doesn't work.","ur":"اے سی کام نہیں کر رہا۔"},{"ar":"Ich brauche ein Handtuch.","roman":"ikh BROW-kheh yn HAHNT-tookh","en":"I need a towel.","ur":"مجھے ایک تولیہ چاہیے۔"},{"ar":"Wann muss ich auschecken?","roman":"vahn moos ikh OWS-check-en","en":"When do I have to check out?","ur":"مجھے کب چیک آؤٹ کرنا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Können Sie mir ein Taxi rufen?","roman":"KÖ-nen zee meer yn TAHK-see ROO-fen","en":"Can you call me a taxi?","ur":"کیا آپ میرے لیے ٹیکسی بلا سکتے ہیں؟","note":"'ö': say 'ay' with rounded lips."}]},
{"id":"de-l07","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":7,"title":"Café & restaurant","phrases":[{"ar":"Einen Tisch für zwei, bitte.","roman":"Y-nen tish für tsvy, BIT-teh","en":"A table for two, please.","ur":"دو لوگوں کے لیے میز، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Die Speisekarte, bitte.","roman":"dee SHPY-zeh-kar-teh, BIT-teh","en":"The menu, please.","ur":"مینو، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Ich hätte gern einen Kaffee.","roman":"ikh HET-teh gern Y-nen KAH-fay","en":"I'd like a coffee.","ur":"مجھے ایک کافی چاہیے۔","note":"'Ich hätte gern' is the polite way to order anything."},{"ar":"Ein Wasser, bitte.","roman":"yn VAHS-ser, BIT-teh","en":"A water, please.","ur":"ایک پانی، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Ist das mit Schweinefleisch?","roman":"ist dahs mit SHVY-neh-flysh","en":"Does this have pork?","ur":"کیا اس میں سور کا گوشت ہے؟"},{"ar":"Haben Sie etwas Vegetarisches?","roman":"HAH-ben zee ET-vahs veh-geh-TAH-rish-es","en":"Do you have something vegetarian?","ur":"کیا آپ کے پاس کچھ سبزی والا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Haben Sie Halal-Essen?","roman":"HAH-ben zee hah-LAHL ES-sen","en":"Do you have halal food?","ur":"کیا آپ کے پاس حلال کھانا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ohne Alkohol, bitte.","roman":"OH-neh AHL-koh-hohl, BIT-teh","en":"Without alcohol, please.","ur":"بغیر الکحل کے، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Das schmeckt sehr gut!","roman":"dahs shmekt zair goot","en":"This tastes very good!","ur":"یہ بہت مزے کا ہے!"},{"ar":"Die Rechnung, bitte.","roman":"dee REKH-noong, BIT-teh","en":"The bill, please.","ur":"بل، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Zusammen oder getrennt?","roman":"tsoo-ZAHM-men OH-der geh-TRENT","en":"Together or separately?","ur":"اکٹھا یا الگ الگ؟","note":"The waiter asks this when you pay."},{"ar":"Stimmt so.","roman":"shtimt zoh","en":"Keep the change.","ur":"باقی رکھ لیں۔","note":"Tip about 5–10% by rounding up."}]},
{"id":"de-l08","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":8,"title":"Shopping & money","phrases":[{"ar":"Ich suche eine Jacke.","roman":"ikh ZOO-kheh Y-neh YAH-keh","en":"I'm looking for a jacket.","ur":"میں ایک جیکٹ ڈھونڈ رہا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Ich schaue nur, danke.","roman":"ikh SHOW-eh noor, DAHN-keh","en":"I'm just looking, thanks.","ur":"میں بس دیکھ رہا ہوں، شکریہ۔"},{"ar":"Haben Sie das in Größe M?","roman":"HAH-ben zee dahs in GRÖ-seh em","en":"Do you have this in size M?","ur":"کیا یہ میڈیم سائز میں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Kann ich das anprobieren?","roman":"kahn ikh dahs AHN-proh-bee-ren","en":"Can I try this on?","ur":"کیا میں اسے پہن کر دیکھ سکتا ہوں؟"},{"ar":"Das ist zu teuer.","roman":"dahs ist tsoo TOY-er","en":"That's too expensive.","ur":"یہ بہت مہنگا ہے۔"},{"ar":"Haben Sie etwas Billigeres?","roman":"HAH-ben zee ET-vahs BIL-lee-geh-res","en":"Do you have something cheaper?","ur":"کیا کچھ سستا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ich nehme das.","roman":"ikh NAY-meh dahs","en":"I'll take this.","ur":"میں یہ لوں گا۔"},{"ar":"Kann ich mit Karte zahlen?","roman":"kahn ikh mit KAR-teh TSAH-len","en":"Can I pay by card?","ur":"کیا میں کارڈ سے ادائیگی کر سکتا ہوں؟","note":"Some small shops still take only cash (bar)."},{"ar":"Bar, bitte.","roman":"bar, BIT-teh","en":"Cash, please.","ur":"نقد، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Eine Tüte, bitte.","roman":"Y-neh TÜ-teh, BIT-teh","en":"A bag, please.","ur":"ایک تھیلا، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Wo ist ein Supermarkt?","roman":"voh ist yn ZOO-per-markt","en":"Where is a supermarket?","ur":"سپر مارکیٹ کہاں ہے؟"}]},
{"id":"de-l09","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":9,"title":"Directions & transport","phrases":[{"ar":"Wo ist der Bahnhof?","roman":"voh ist dair BAHN-hohf","en":"Where is the train station?","ur":"ریلوے اسٹیشن کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Wie komme ich zum Hotel?","roman":"vee KOM-meh ikh tsoom hoh-TEL","en":"How do I get to the hotel?","ur":"میں ہوٹل کیسے پہنچوں؟"},{"ar":"Geradeaus.","roman":"geh-RAH-deh-ows","en":"Straight ahead.","ur":"سیدھا۔"},{"ar":"Links. / Rechts.","roman":"links. / rekhts","en":"Left. / Right.","ur":"بائیں۔ / دائیں۔"},{"ar":"Ist es weit?","roman":"ist es vyt","en":"Is it far?","ur":"کیا یہ دور ہے؟"},{"ar":"Fünf Minuten zu Fuß.","roman":"fünf mee-NOO-ten tsoo foos","en":"Five minutes on foot.","ur":"پیدل پانچ منٹ۔"},{"ar":"Eine Fahrkarte nach Berlin, bitte.","roman":"Y-neh FAR-kar-teh nahkh ber-LEEN, BIT-teh","en":"A ticket to Berlin, please.","ur":"برلن کا ایک ٹکٹ، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Hin und zurück.","roman":"hin oont tsoo-RÜK","en":"Return (there and back).","ur":"آنا جانا۔"},{"ar":"Von welchem Gleis?","roman":"fon VEL-khem glys","en":"From which platform?","ur":"کس پلیٹ فارم سے؟"},{"ar":"Hält dieser Zug in Köln?","roman":"helt DEE-zer tsook in köln","en":"Does this train stop in Cologne?","ur":"کیا یہ ٹرین کولون میں رکتی ہے؟"},{"ar":"Wo ist die U-Bahn?","roman":"voh ist dee OO-bahn","en":"Where is the metro?","ur":"میٹرو کہاں ہے؟"}]},
{"id":"de-l10","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":10,"title":"Small talk & work","phrases":[{"ar":"Ich bin IT-Ingenieur.","roman":"ikh bin ee-TAY in-zhen-YÖR","en":"I'm an IT engineer.","ur":"میں آئی ٹی انجینئر ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Ich arbeite in Dubai.","roman":"ikh AR-by-teh in doo-BY","en":"I work in Dubai.","ur":"میں دبئی میں کام کرتا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Was machen Sie beruflich?","roman":"vahs MAH-khen zee beh-ROOF-likh","en":"What do you do for work?","ur":"آپ کیا کام کرتے ہیں؟"},{"ar":"Ich lerne Deutsch.","roman":"ikh LER-neh doytsh","en":"I'm learning German.","ur":"میں جرمن سیکھ رہا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Mein Deutsch ist nicht so gut.","roman":"myn doytsh ist nikht zoh goot","en":"My German isn't so good.","ur":"میری جرمن اتنی اچھی نہیں ہے۔"},{"ar":"Das Wetter ist schön heute.","roman":"dahs VET-ter ist shön HOY-teh","en":"The weather is nice today.","ur":"آج موسم اچھا ہے۔"},{"ar":"Es ist kalt!","roman":"es ist kahlt","en":"It's cold!","ur":"ٹھنڈ ہے!"},{"ar":"Haben Sie Kinder?","roman":"HAH-ben zee KIN-der","en":"Do you have children?","ur":"کیا آپ کے بچے ہیں؟"},{"ar":"Ja, ich habe zwei Kinder.","roman":"yah, ikh HAH-beh tsvy KIN-der","en":"Yes, I have two children.","ur":"جی، میرے دو بچے ہیں۔"},{"ar":"Das ist interessant!","roman":"dahs ist in-teh-reh-SAHNT","en":"That's interesting!","ur":"یہ دلچسپ ہے!"},{"ar":"Schönes Wochenende!","roman":"SHÖ-nes VO-khen-en-deh","en":"Have a nice weekend!","ur":"ہفتے کا اختتام اچھا گزرے!"},{"ar":"Bis morgen!","roman":"bis MOR-gen","en":"See you tomorrow!","ur":"کل ملتے ہیں!"}]}
]
